                <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/95 text-charcoal text-[11px] font-semibold flex items-center gap-1 shadow-xs">
                  <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 fill-amber-400" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>
                  4.9 (1,840)
                </span>
              </div>
              <div class="absolute bottom-3 left-4 right-4 flex items-center justify-between text-white text-xs">
                <span>18 Video Lessons</span>
                <span>Printable Script PDF</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4">
              <div>
                <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-berry uppercase tracking-wider block">Ages 1.5 – 5 Years</span>
                <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-charcoal mt-1 leading-snug">
                  The Calm Toddler Blueprint: Taming Tantrums & Big Emotions
                </h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-mutedText mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                  Learn exactly what to say during meltdowns, bedtime resistance, and aggressive hitting without yelling, bribes, or punishment.
